An effort level is a string the chat template renders as a sentence, not a
number the template happens to accept. `effort` bound to anything but
non-empty text is a different finding from the key being absent -- that case
is `ReasoningPairIncomplete` -- and gets its own refusal so a reader is told
which of the two documents it is reading: one where the level was never
written, and one where something else was written in its place.
